### Note: This file is used to test and validate the Employee Management Endpoints.
### It aligns perfectly with the EmployeeController routes and MediatR commands.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5165/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Register a New Employee
### Creates a new staff/employee account profile with role assignment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Employee
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "Issa@gmail.com",
  "password": "Issa1234#",
  "firstName": "Issa",
  "lastName": "Atieh",
  "phoneNumber": "0780830732",
  "address": "Al-Zarqa",
  "userName": "Issa",
  "countryId": 113,
  "birthDate": "1973-10-06",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "employeeCode": "230221",
  "roleId": 1
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Get Paginated Employees List
### Retrieves a list of employees using query string paging configuration parameters.
GET {{baseUrl}}/Employee?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Get Authenticated Employee Profile
### Requires authentication cookie context. Automatically reads the User Id from the claims token.
GET {{baseUrl}}/Employee/EmployeeProfile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4. Update Employee Information
### Modifies account attributes. Route parameter userId must match the request body payload UserId.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Employee/update-employee-info/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 2,
  "firstName": "Issa",
  "lastName": "Atieh",
  "address": "Al-Zarqa",
  "employeeCode": "230221",
  "phoneNumber": "0780830732",
  "email": "Issa@gmail.com",
  "userName": "IIssadev",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-10-06",
  "countryId": 113
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5. Delete Employee Profile (Soft Delete)
### Executes a soft delete logic sequence by flagging the target employee tracking record.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Employee/delete-employee/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Restore Soft-Deleted Employee
### Reverts the soft delete state to grant the employee access back to system resources.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Employee/restore-employee/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}